📊 RetailMart Country Sales Analysis

A Multi-Country Retail Sales Analysis Project Using SQL, PostgreSQL, and Power BI

📌 Project Overview

The RetailMart Country Sales Analysis project analyzes retail transaction data from six countries: Canada, China, India, Nigeria, the United Kingdom, and the United States.

The project combines country-wise sales datasets, performs data validation and transformation using SQL in PostgreSQL, and presents sales information through interactive Microsoft Power BI dashboards.

The goal is to provide a consolidated view of retail sales performance and help users explore sales trends, product performance, payment methods, customer demographics, and geographic distribution.

🎯 Project Objectives

- Consolidate sales data from six countries into a unified dataset.
- Perform data validation and cleaning using SQL.
- Identify missing values and potential duplicate transactions.
- Calculate transaction amounts and profit using defined business rules.
- Analyze sales performance across countries and product categories.
- Explore customer demographic attributes and payment methods.
- Develop interactive Power BI dashboards for business reporting.
- Present sales information in a clear, visual, and accessible format.

