⚠️ Data Limitations

- Data quality issues may affect the accuracy of analysis if they are not resolved.
- Profit results depend on the definition of cost and the calculation implemented in SQL.
- The listed source columns do not include a unique customer identifier, so a reliable unique-customer count cannot be calculated from these fields alone.
- Geographic analysis is limited to the geographic information available in the source data.
- Dashboard results depend on the quality and completeness of the underlying data.

